        "side": "new",
        "severity": "low",
        "category": "error-handling",
        "title": "Early returns leave dev->started set",
        "explanation": "If peer_db_set is missing or fails, dev_stop returns without masking doorbells or clearing dev->started. The device stays marked as started even though the link has already been cleaned up.",
